  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Out-of-bounds write in the bundled xdgmime magic parser\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-16118.patch: parenthesize (ptr + i) before the\n       cast in _xdg_mime_magic_parse_magic_line() in gio/xdgmime/xdgmimemagic.c,\n       so the little-endian byte swap writes at byte offsets instead of scaling\n       by sizeof(type) and writing past the end of matchlet->value and\n       matchlet->mask\n     - CVE-2026-16118",
